sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider
    participant Q as Delivery queue
    participant E as Customer endpoint
    P->>Q: Enqueue event (id, payload)
    Q->>E: POST (signed, timestamp)
    alt 2xx within timeout
        E-->>Q: 200 OK
        Q->>P: Mark delivered
    else error or timeout
        E-->>Q: 500 or no reply
        Note over Q: Retry with backoff + jitter
        Q->>E: POST (same event id)
    end
    Note over Q,E: After max attempts: dead-letter and alert
